Error: prompt is required
Try tool calling with two demo tools

Usage: wally llm tool-call [OPTIONS] prompt

Arguments:
  prompt                      What to ask the model

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            Model to use (default qwen3-0.6b)
      --engine TEXT           Engine to run on
      --tool-choice TEXT      When the model may call tools: auto, required, none, specific
      --force-tool TEXT       Force one tool by name (implies --tool-choice specific)
      --max-tool-calls INT    Cap on tool calls per turn (default 3)

Examples:
  wally llm tool-call "weather in Paris?"       Calls get_weather
  wally llm tool-call "what is 19 * 23?"        Calls calculate
